# WorkBuddy local memory
# 整目录忽略，但放行协同开发所需的三个子目录（任务Spec/审查记录/项目记忆），供多AI可见
.workbuddy/*
# .workbuddy/memory/ 含个人工作日志与真实业务台账，对外分享严禁入库（保持忽略）
!.workbuddy/reviews/
!.workbuddy/tasks/

# Screenshots & verification artifacts
screenshot_*.png
verify_shots/
verify_*.log
*.timestamp-*.mjs
scripts/screenshot_*.py

# Temp / smoke-test artifacts (one-off, not part of project)
emf_check.bmp
frontend/obsidian_link_smoke.mjs
frontend/smoke_check_0717.mjs
shot_econtract.mjs

# MSYS 设备名怪象（Git Bash 下误建的 nul 文件，Windows 视为保留设备无法删除）
/nul
backend/nul

# Session temp files（会话开发时随手建的临时脚本/测试产物，非源码，永不被提交）
tmp_*

